# Le Dockerfile sandbox est content-hashé (#405) : figer les fins de ligne pour que le
# tag pdo-sandbox:h-<hash> soit identique quel que soit l'OS de checkout/build (release/GHCR #411).
crates/pdo-sandbox/assets/sandbox/Dockerfile text eol=lf

# Every ticket of a story adds its entry under `## Unreleased` (ADR
# draft-version-changelog-et-numero-d-adr-se-fixent-a-la-fusion-vers-main): two tickets appending
# at the same place would conflict on every merge. The union driver keeps the lines of both sides.
CHANGELOG.md merge=union
